# 基础词 Unit10
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2023红宝书考研英语词汇-基础词
# 描述: 基础词Unit10核心词汇

{{chase}}{/tʃeɪs/}{{v. 追逐；追赶；n. 追逐}}{{The dog chased the cat around the yard.}}
{{cheap}}{/tʃiːp/}{{adj. 便宜的；廉价的}}{{This shirt was very cheap at the sale.}}
{{cheat}}{/tʃiːt/}{{v. 欺骗；作弊；n. 骗子}}{{Cheating on exams is strictly prohibited.}}
{{check}}{/tʃek/}{{v. 检查；n. 检查；支票}}{{Please check your answers before submitting the test.}}
{{cheek}}{/tʃiːk/}}{{n. 脸颊；面颊}}{{She kissed him on the cheek.}}
{{cheer}}{/tʃɪər/}{{v. 欢呼；n. 欢呼}}{{The crowd cheered when the team scored a goal.}}
{{chemical}}{/ˈkemɪkl/}{{adj. 化学的；n. 化学品}}{{The factory produces various chemical products.}}
{{chest}}{/tʃest/}{{n. 胸部；箱子}}{{He felt a pain in his chest after running.}}
{{chicken}}{/ˈtʃɪkɪn/}{{n. 鸡；鸡肉}}{{We had grilled chicken for dinner.}}
{{chief}}{/tʃiːf/}{{adj. 主要的；n. 首领}}{{Safety is our chief concern in this project.}}
{{child}}{/tʃaɪld/}{{n. 孩子；儿童}}{{Every child deserves a good education.}}
{{choice}}{/tʃɔɪs/}{{n. 选择；选择权}}{{You have the choice between two options.}}
{{choose}}{/tʃuːz/}{{v. 选择；挑选}}{{She chose the blue dress for the party.}}
{{church}}{/tʃɜːrtʃ/}{{n. 教堂；教会}}{{They go to church every Sunday morning.}}
{{circle}}{/ˈsɜːrkl/}}n. 圆；圈子；v. 环绕}}{{The children sat in a circle on the floor.}}
{{circumstance}}{/ˈsɜːrkəmstæns/}{{n. 情况；环境}}{{Under no circumstance should you leave the building.}}
{{citizen}}{/ˈsɪtɪzn/}}n. 公民；市民}}{{Every citizen has the right to vote.}}
{{city}}{/ˈsɪti/}}n. 城市}}{{Shanghai is one of the largest cities in the world.}}
{{civil}}{/ˈsɪvl/}}adj. 公民的；文明的}}{{Civil rights are protected by the constitution.}}
{{claim}}{/kleɪm/}}v. 声称；索取；n. 声称}}{{He claimed that he was innocent of the crime.}}
{{class}}{/klɑːs/}}n. 班级；课程；阶级}}{{She is at the top of her class in mathematics.}}
{{classic}}{/ˈklæsɪk/}}adj. 经典的；n. 经典作品}}{{This novel is a classic of English literature.}}
{{classroom}}{/ˈklɑːsrʊm/}}n. 教室}}{{The classroom was decorated with colorful posters.}}
{{clean}}{/kliːn/}}adj. 干净的；v. 清洁}}{{Please keep your room clean and tidy.}}
{{clear}}{/klɪər/}}adj. 清楚的；v. 清除}}{{The instructions are very clear and easy to follow.}}
{{clerk}}{/klɑːrk/}}n. 职员；店员}}{{The clerk at the hotel was very helpful.}}
{{clever}}{/ˈklevər/}}adj. 聪明的；机灵的}}{{She is a clever student who learns quickly.}}
{{climate}}{/ˈklaɪmət/}}n. 气候}}{{The climate in this region is warm and humid.}}
{{climb}}{/klaɪm/}}v. 攀登；爬}}{{They climbed to the top of the mountain.}}
{{cling}}{/klɪŋ/}}v. 紧贴；依附}}{{The child clung to his mother's hand.}}
{{clock}}{/klɒk/}}n. 时钟}}{{The clock on the wall shows it is noon.}}
{{close}}{/kləʊs/}}adj. 近的；亲密的；v. 关闭}}{{The store closes at 9 p.m. every night.}}
{{cloth}}{/klɒθ/}}n. 布；织物}}{{She wiped the table with a damp cloth.}}
{{clothes}}{/kləʊðz/}}n. 衣服}}{{She bought new clothes for the job interview.}}
{{cloud}}{/klaʊd/}}n. 云；阴影}}{{Dark clouds gathered in the sky before the storm.}}
{{club}}{/klʌb/}}n. 俱乐部；社团}}{{He joined the football club at school.}}
{{clue}}{/kluː/}}n. 线索；提示}}{{The detective found an important clue at the crime scene.}}
{{coach}}{/kəʊtʃ/}}n. 教练；长途汽车；v. 训练}}{{The coach trained the team for the championship.}}
{{coal}}{/kəʊl/}}n. 煤；煤炭}}{{Coal was once the main source of energy for heating.}}
{{coast}}{/kəʊst/}}n. 海岸；沿海地区}}{{They drove along the coast enjoying the ocean view.}}
